WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.399
JON JON
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:00:03.321 --> 00:00:06.048
The fight we've
all been waiting for!

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.896
SHANG-CHI
It's time to show the world

00:00:08.946 --> 00:00:10.012
who I really am.

00:00:12.188 --> 00:00:15.474
WENWU
My son... Join the army of the Ten Rings.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.393
SHANG-CHI
My name is Shang-Chi.

00:00:21.443 --> 00:00:22.440
KATY
You're such a badass.

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:23.315
SHANG-CHI
Thank you.

